                            <comment id="496008" author="adilger" created="Thu, 11 Jun 2026 15:42:45 +0000">&lt;p&gt;This is failing regularly in interop testing with b2_15 clients and master servers. Possibly something that was disabled in this subtest in master?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="496011" author="adilger" created="Thu, 11 Jun 2026 15:58:17 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dongyang" class="user-hover" rel="dongyang"&gt;dongyang&lt;/a&gt; it looks like these many interop failures are due to the MMP changes in your &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19784" title="conf-sanity test_73b: tunefs.lustre takes very long with ldiskfs" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19784"&gt;LU-19784&lt;/a&gt; patch. Fixing all of the old branches is problematic. It would've better to add a &lt;tt&gt;lustre/trsts/except/mmp.ex&lt;/tt&gt; file that only runs interop testing with clients &amp;gt; 2.17.5x where your patch was landed. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
